        "text": "Page: Myles Kennedy. Sentence: Myles Richard Kennedy (born Myles Richard Bass; November 27, 1969) is an American musician, singer, and songwriter, best known as the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of the rock band Alter Bridge, and as the lead vocalist in guitarist Slash's backing band, known as Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\nPage: SafetySuit. Sentence: SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma, currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\nPage: Rise Today. Sentence: Written by lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy, it was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette and featured on the band's 2007 second studio album \"Blackbird\".\nPage: Life Left to Go. Sentence: Life Left to Go is the debut studio album by American rock band SafetySuit, released on May 13, 2008, through Universal Motown Records.",
